Design a 4-bit signed greater-than-or-equal-to (GTE) comparator. This module takes two 4-bit signed inputs, A and B, and outputs a signal indicating whether A is greater than or equal to B. When A is greater than or equal to B, the output GTE is asserted high (1); otherwise, it is low (0).
module top_module(
    input signed [3:0] A,
    input signed [3:0] B,
    output reg GTE
);

